    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean yeah i know i should probably talk to someone but it feels so pointless. like what am i even gonna say? \"i have a great life but i feel nothing\"? people will just think i'm being ungrateful or dramatic. it’s just this constant, heavy silence in my head. it's like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. i'm just tired of existing in this void.",
